    exampleLabel: "📄 Iryna's Sample Certificate",
    exampleP: "Below is an example of a Gewinnbestätigung, based on real practical experience. This is an example of an informational document from practical experience, not an official BMI form, and is for reference only. The data and figures relate solely to the character Iryna's situation. Do not use it as a template.",
