    cardValidityNote: "On card validity, separately: according to BMI, the first Rot-Weiß-Rot – Karte plus is normally issued for one year. A three-year card can be issued if the person has been continuously resident in Austria for at least 2 years and fulfils the relevant Integrationsvereinbarung requirement (Modul 1). Card validity also cannot exceed the passport's validity.",
